## Api TMDB

### Récupérer les films populaires
GET {{base_url}}movie/popular
Authorization: Bearer {{jeton}}

### Détails d'un film
GET {{base_url}}movie/1226863
Authorization: Bearer {{jeton}}

### Acteurs d'un film
GET {{base_url}}movie/1226863/credits
Authorization: Bearer {{jeton}}

### Recherche de film
GET search/movie?query=mario&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{jeton}}


## Strapi

### Créer utilisateur Strapi
POST http://localhost:1337/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "enzo",
  "email": "enzo@example.com",
  "password": "MotDePasseFort123"
}

### Connexion à l'utilisateur
POST http://localhost:1337/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "enzo@example.com",
  "password": "MotDePasseFort123"
}


### Créer un acteur sur Strapi
POST http://localhost:1337/api/actors
Authorization: Bearer {{strapi_jeton}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "Chris Pratt"
  }
}

