### Tous les films Strapi
GET http://localhost:1337/api/movies
Authorization: Bearer {{strapi_jeton}}
Accept: application/json


### Films contenant "H"
GET http://localhost:1337/api/movies?filters[title][$contains]=H
Accept: application/json


### Films avec acteurs (populate)
GET http://localhost:1337/api/movies?populate=actors
Accept: application/json
